{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53217","headline":"诗偈 四十二 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 四十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"达人知是幻，纵损心亦如。\n诸天不免难，况复此阎浮。\n须寻无上理，莫更苦踟蹰。\n衣食才方足，不用积盈余。\n少欲有湼盘，知足非凡夫。\n当来无地狱，现在出三涂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}